  "title_zh": "中国10月底外汇储备约3.4万亿美元，央行连续24个月买黄金",
  "title_en": "China's FX reserves were about $3.4 trillion at end-October; central bank added gold for a 24th straight month",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月7日，国家外汇管理局公布了最新数据。到10月底，中国的外汇储备是34052亿美元，比9月底多了49亿美元，增加了0.14%。这是外汇储备连续第七个月高于3.4万亿美元。",
      "en": "On November 7, the State Administration of Foreign Exchange released the latest data. At the end of October, China's foreign exchange reserves stood at 3,405.2 billion US dollars, 4.9 billion dollars more than at the end of September, a rise of 0.14%. This is the seventh month in a row that the reserves have been above 3.4 trillion dollars."
    },
    {
      "zh": "外汇储备是国家持有的外国货币和外国资产，比如美元。外汇管理局说，10月储备增加，是因为汇率折算和资产价格发生了变化。",
      "en": "Foreign exchange reserves are the foreign currencies and foreign assets that a country holds, such as US dollars. The administration said the reserves rose in October because of exchange-rate conversion and changes in asset prices."
    },
    {
      "zh": "10月，美元指数上涨0.4%，升到101.9。欧元对美元下跌1.5%，日元下跌0.1%，英镑上涨1.0%。美国的标普500指数下跌了0.9%。",
      "en": "In October, the US dollar index rose 0.4% to 101.9. The euro fell 1.5% against the dollar, the yen fell 0.1%, and the pound rose 1.0%. The US S&P 500 index fell 0.9%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "中国人民银行也公布了黄金储备的数字。10月底，中国的黄金储备是7830万盎司，比9月底多了83万盎司。这是央行连续第24个月增加黄金。",
      "en": "The People's Bank of China also released its gold reserve figure. At the end of October, China's gold reserves were 78.3 million ounces, 830,000 ounces more than at the end of September. This is the 24th month in a row that the central bank has added gold."
    }
  ],
